to reduce the military rank of<div>degradieren</div></li><li>of a male voice, to become deeper at puberty<div>einen / den Stimmbruch haben</div></li><li>to win a game as receiver in tennis<div>einen Break machen</div></li><li>to become audible suddenly<div>hereinbrechen</div></li><li>intransitive: to stop functioning properly or altogether<div>kaputtgehen</div></li><li>transitive: to cause to stop functioning<div>kaputtmachen</div></li><li>to divide (money) into smaller units<div>kleinmachen</div></li><li>to interrupt or cease one's work or occupation temporarily<div>pausieren</div></li><li>to suddenly become<ol><li><div>verwandeln</div></li><li><div>wenden</div></li><li><div>werden</div></li></ol></li><li>of a spell of weather: to end<ol><li><div>wechseln</div></li><li><div>zu Ende gehen</div></li></ol></li><li>to cause a person to lose spirit or will<div>zerbrechen</div></li><li>to ruin financially<div>zugrunde richten</div></li><li>to turn an animal into a beast of burden<ol><li><div>zureiten</div></li><li><div>zähmen</div></li></ol></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to take a stand<div>eine Lanze brechen</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">interjection</font></div>expression of best wishes to a performer<ol><li><div>Hals- und Beinbruch!</div></li><li><div>Mast- und Schotbruch!</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>to start sweating<div>ins Schwitzen kommen</div></li><li>to put effort into something<ol><li><div>ins Schwitzen kommen</div></li><li><div>sich ins Zeug legen</div></li></ol></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>to become separated<ol><li><div>ablösen</div></li><li><div>lösen</div></li></ol></li><li>to leave suddenly<ol><li><div>ausbrechen</div></li><li><div>losmachen</div></li></ol></li></ol></div><div>/<font color="gray">bɹeɪk bæd</font>/, /<font color="gray">bɹæɪ̯k bæːd</font>/<br>
