ont class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div><ol><li><div>Eintritt verboten</div></li><li><div>keine Einfahrt</div></li><li><div>nicht eintreten</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>go away<div>abhauen</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>do what one considers best<div>sein Ding machen</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>irritate, disturb<ol><li><div>gaga machen</div></li><li><div>kirre machen</div></li><li><div>wahnsinnig machen</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to wash up dishes<ol><li><div>abwaschen</div></li><li><div>spülen</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><div>das Unmögliche tun</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to wash the laundry<ol><li><div>die Wäsche machen</div></li><li><div>waschen</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to figure it out yourself<ol><li><div>rechne es dir selbst aus</div></li><li><div>überzeuge dich selbst</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>colloquial: to spend time in prison<ol><li><div>sitzen</div></li><li><div>einsitzen</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">proverb</font></div>One should treat others as one would like others to treat oneself<div>behandle andere so, wie du von ihnen behandelt werden willst</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>do you accept American dollars?<div>akzeptieren Sie US-Dollar?</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>do you accept credit cards?<ol><li><div>akzeptieren Sie Kreditkarten?</div></li><li><div>nehmen Sie Kreditkarten?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</f