<div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>used to indicate a total swift victory<ol><li><div>ich kam, ich sah, ich siegte</div></li><li><div>kam, sah und siegte</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I can't find my ...<ol><li><div>ich kann mein ... nicht finden</div></li><li><div>ich kann meine ... nicht finden</div></li><li><div>ich kann meinen ... nicht finden</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I can't swim<div>ich kann nicht schwimmen</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I am very hungry<ol><li><div>ich habe Hunger wie ein Bär</div></li><li><div>ich habe Hunger wie ein Wolf</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>traditional phrase said upon acceptance of marriage<div>ja, ich will</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I don't care<div>das ist mir egal</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I don't drive (a car, a vehicle)<div>ich fahre kein Auto</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I don't eat beef<div>ich esse kein Rindfleisch</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I don't eat fish<div>ich esse keinen Fisch</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I don't eat meat<div>ich esse kein Fleisch</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I don't eat pork<div>ich esse kein Schweinefleisch</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>you want someone to do something faster<div>Ich habe nicht den ganzen Tag Zeit</div></div><div>/<font color="gray">[ɑ̈ɪ̯ (ɾ)oʊ̯̃(ʔ)(t̚) noʊ̯]</font>/<br>
