ent before it was made<div>ich weiß</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>assertion that an insult made by the party to whom the phrase is directed is actually true of that party<ol><li><div>selber, selber, lachen alle Kälber</div></li><li><div>wer es sagt, der ist es selber</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I like you<ol><li><div>Sie gefallen mir</div></li><li><div>du gefällst mir</div></li><li><div>ich mag Sie</div></li><li><div>ich mag dich</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I live in Melbourne (example city)<div>ich wohne in Melbourne</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I lost my backpack<div>ich habe meinen Rucksack verloren</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I lost my glasses<div>ich habe meine Brille verloren</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I lost my handbag<div>ich habe meine Handtasche verloren</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I lost my keys<div>ich habe meine Schlüssel verloren</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>I lost my wallet<div>ich habe meine Brieftasche verloren</div></div><div>/<font color="gray">aɪ ˈlʊv juː</font>/, /<font color="gray">aɪ ˈlʌv juː</font>/<br>
