v><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>To embarrass oneself or others in public<ol><li><div>eine lächerliche Figur abgeben</div></li><li><div>sich lächerlich machen</div></li><li><div>sich zum Affen machen</div></li><li><div>unangenehm auffallen</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to produce something refined, from something which is unrefined<div>aus Scheiße Geld machen</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>To embarrass oneself or others in public<ol><li><div>blamieren</div></li><li><div>eine lächerliche Figur abgeben</div></li><li><div>sich lächerlich machen</div></li><li><div>sich zum Affen machen</div></li><li><div>sich zum Narren machen</div></li><li><div>unangenehm auffallen</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to make the best of a difficult situation<div>aus der Not eine Tugend machen</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to repair a relationship; to make up; to resolve an argument or fight; to make reparations or redress<div>Genugtuung leisten</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to try; to work towards a goal<ol><li><div>anstrengen</div></li><li><div>sich Mühe geben</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>punish someone as a warning to others<div>ein Exempel statuieren</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to embarrass oneself in public<ol><li><div>blamieren</div></li><li><div>sich zum Narren machen</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to pretend<div>so tun, als ob</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to knead with the front paws<div>den Milchtritt machen</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li><div>zurechtkommen</div></li><li><div>auskommen</div></li><li><div>hinkommen</div></li><li><div>hinlangen</div></li><li><div>hinreichen</div></li><li><div>klarkommen</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>get by financially<ol><li><div>über die Runden kommen</div></li><li><div>über den Monat kommen</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to flirt by making obvious glances<ol><li><div>Augen machen</div></li><li><div>schöne Augen machen</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to make flexible - translation entry<div>flexibilisieren</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>set out to go to, move towards<ol><li><div>sich zusteuern auf</div></li><li><div>zustreben</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>to befriend, to become closer<div>anfreunden</div></li><li>to create friendships<ol><li><div>anfreunden</div></li><li><div>Freunde finden</div></li></ol></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>tease, ridicule<ol><li><div>verspotten</div></li><li><div>auslachen</div></li><li><div>lustig machen</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>to cut grass to turn into hay<div>Heu machen</div></li><li>to take advantage of an opportunity<ol><li><div>ausschlachten</div></li><li><div>beweisen</div></li><li><div>die Gelegenheit beim Schopf ergreifen</div></li><li><div>hervortun</div></li><li><div>profilieren</div></li></ol></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>act while an opportunity exists<div>das Eisen schmieden, so lange es heißt ist</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>understand even minimally<div>sich einen Reim darauf machen</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>do something that will be widely remembered for a long time<div>Geschichte schreiben</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>to become famous and successful</li><li>to succeed in doing something, for example in reaching a place, or getting there on time</li><li>to survive, to live through something</li></ol><div>schaffen</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to do it quickly<ol><li><div>Mach fix!</div></li><li><div>Mach hin!</div></li><li><div>dalli-dalli!</div></li><li><div>ranhalten</div></li><li><div>zack-zack!</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div><ol><li>to disclose a secret<ol><li><div>ausplaudern</div></li><li><div>verraten</div></li><li><div>weitersagen</div></li></ol></li><li>to announce generally<ol><li><div>bekanntmachen</div></li><li><div>verkünden</div></li></ol></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>regard without due seriousness<ol><li><div>auf die leichte Schulter nehmen</div></li><li><div>nicht allzu ernst nehmen</div></li><li><div>sich nicht viel machen aus</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to engage in sexual intercourse<ol><li><div>Liebe machen</div></li><li><div>miteinander schlafen</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>hippie anti-war slogan<div>Mach Liebe, nicht Krieg</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>make a profit<ol><li><div>Geld einbringen</div></li><li><div>Geld machen</div></li><li><div>Geld verdienen</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">verb</font></div>to sing or play a musical instrument<div>musizieren</div></div><div>/<font color="gray">ˌmeɪk noʊ ˈboʊnz əˌbaʊt</font>/, /<font color="gray">ˌmeɪk nəʊ ˈbəʊnz əˌbaʊt</font>/<br>
