<div><font class="grammar" color="green">particle</font></div><ol><li>used to show agreement with a negative question (in some languages this response is the usual word for "yes")<div>nein</div></li><li>used to show disagreement or negation<ol><li><div>nein</div></li><li><div>nee</div></li><li><div>nö</div></li></ol></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div><div>kein Problem</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">interjection</font></div>Response affirming that the speaker does not have knowledge pertaining to an interlocutor's question<div>keine Ahnung</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div><ol><li>"official" refusal to relay any further information</li><li>refusal to say the obvious impolite retort</li></ol><div>kein Kommentar</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adverb</font></div>without a doubt<ol><li><div>zweifellos</div></li><li><div>fraglos</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>entry is forbidden<ol><li><div>Eingang verboten</div></li><li><div>Eintritt verboten</div></li><li><div>Zutritt verboten</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">noun</font></div>something which should not or cannot be done<div>No-Go</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">proverb</font></div>beneficial actions often go unappreciated etc.<div>der Fluch der guten Tat</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adjective</font></div><div>alles ist erlaubt</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">interjection</font></div>I don't know<div>keine Ahnung</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">interjection</font></div><ol><li><div>ach was</div></li><li><div>echt</div></li><li><div>im Ernst</div></li><li><div>kein Quatsch</div></li><li><div>was du nicht sagst</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar"