<div><font class="grammar" color="green">pronoun</font></div><ol><li><ol><li>what? (interrogative pronoun)</li><li>fused relative pronoun: that which; those that; the thing(s) that</li></ol><div>was</div></li><li>nonstandard relative pronoun<ol><li><div>was</div></li><li><div>das</div></li><li><div>der</div></li><li><div>die</div></li></ol></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what a lovely day<div>was für ein schöner Tag</div></div><div>/<font color="gray">ˌwɔt ə ˈpɪtɪj</font>/, /<font color="gray">ˌwʌt ə ˈpɪti/ [ˌwɐɾ ə ˈpʰɪɾi ~ ˌwɜɾ ə ˈpʰɪɾi]</font>/, /<font color="gray">ˌʍɔt ə ˈpɪte</font>/<br>
<div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>used to express regret<ol><li><div>schade</div></li><li><div>das ist aber schade</div></li><li><div>wie schade</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adverb</font></div><ol><li>used to ask someone to consider something or someone that they have apparently not considered<ol><li><div>und</div></li><li><div>was ist mit</div></li></ol></li><li>used to make a suggestion<div>wie wär's mit</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what are you doing<ol><li><div>was machen Sie?</div></li><li><div>was machst du?</div></li><li><div>was tun Sie?</div></li><li><div>was tust du?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>indicating that there is nothing to be said which would improve matters<div>was soll ich sagen</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what date is it today?<ol><li><div>den wievielten haben wir heute?</div></li><li><div>der wievielte ist heute?</div></li><li><div>welches Datum ist heute?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what day is it today? (current day of the week or of the month)<ol><li><div>den Wievielten haben wir heute</div></li><li><div>was ist heute für ein Tag</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">interjection</font></div><div>was kümmert es mich</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what a surprise<div>Wer hätte das gedacht?</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what do you mean? (request for clarification)<div>was meinst du?</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div><ol><li>used to ask someone if they are willing to do something<ol><li><div>was denkst du?</div></li><li><div>was meinst du?</div></li></ol></li><li>used to remind a child to say a polite expression<div>wie sagt man</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>a comment used to indicate that a previous comment is irrelevant or unimportant<div>nachts ist es kälter als draußen</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what does … mean?<div>was bedeutet …?</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">proverb</font></div>hardship builds moral character<div>was dich nicht umbringt, macht dich stärker</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adverb</font></div>for what reason; why<div>wofür</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">proverb</font></div>actions have consequences<ol><li><div>wie man in den Wald hineinruft, so schallt es heraus</div></li><li><div>alles rächt sich irgendwann</div></li><li><div>das kommt davon</div></li><li><div>die Vergangenheit holt einen immer ein</div></li><li><div>man erntet, was man sät</div></li><li><div>sowas kommt von sowas</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">pronoun</font></div>any of several additional things<ol><li><div>oder so</div></li><li><div>und so weiter</div></li><li><div>und, und, und</div></li><li><div>was auch immer</div></li><li><div>was weiß ich</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adverb</font></div>used to introduce suggestion<div>was wenn</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what is her name?<div>wie heißt sie?</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what is his name?<div>wie heißt er?</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adverb</font></div><div>außerdem</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what is that?<div>was ist das</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what is the Wi-Fi password?<ol><li><div>was ist das WLAN-Passwort?</div></li><li><div>wie lautet das WLAN-Passwort?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what is your name?<ol><li><div>was ist Ihr Name?</div></li><li><div>was ist dein Name?</div></li><li><div>wie heißen Sie?</div></li><li><div>wie heißt du?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">determiner</font></div><div>was für</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what kind of music do you like?<ol><li><div>was für Musik magst du?</div></li><li><div>welche Art von Musik mögen Sie?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what languages do you speak?<ol><li><div>welche Sprachen sprechen Sie?</div></li><li><div>welche Sprachen sprichst du?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>that is nonsense<ol><li><div>was für ein Schwachsinn</div></li><li><div>was für ein Unsinn</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">adverb</font></div>what number, which (in a numbered series)<div>wievielter</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">interjection</font></div>so what<div>na und</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what should I do?<div>[[was sollte ich tun?]]</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">noun</font></div><div>was in dir steckt</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">interjection</font></div>used to add emphasis to "what" when beginning question<div>was zum Teufel</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">interjection</font></div><ol><li>expressing nonchalance<div>was auch immer</div></li><li>expressing astonishment<ol><li><div>was zum Teufel?</div></li><li><div>was zur Scheiße?</div></li></ol></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>intensive form of what<ol><li><div>was zum Teufel?</div></li><li><div>was zur Scheiße?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>softer form of "what the hell"<ol><li><div>was zum Henker</div></li><li><div>was zum Kuckuck</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div><ol><li>why not?<ol><li><div>scheiß drauf</div></li><li><div>was soll's</div></li></ol></li><li>an intensive form of what<ol><li><div>was zum Teufel?</div></li><li><div>was zur Hölle</div></li></ol></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>intensive form of what<div>was zum Scheiß</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what is the time of day?<ol><li><div>wie spät ist es</div></li><li><div>wieviel Uhr ist es?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>used to ask the interlocutor what they would like to order, to buy or have a look at<ol><li><div>was möchten Sie?</div></li><li><div>was wollen Sie?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>(idiomatic, computing) the screen image resembles the printed output<div>was du siehst, ist was du bekommst</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">proverb</font></div><div>was passiert ist, ist passiert</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">interjection</font></div>an informal greeting<ol><li><div>wie geht's</div></li><li><div>was geht ab?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what are the advantages to me<ol><li><div>was hab ich davon</div></li><li><div>was springt für mich dabei heraus</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>(defensively) why are you asking?<ol><li><div>was geht dich das an?</div></li><li><div>wozu willst du das wissen?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>informal greeting asking what has happened recently<div>was gibt's Neues</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div><div>was will man mehr</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">proverb</font></div>if something is acceptable for one person, it is acceptable for another<div>was dem einen recht ist, ist dem anderen billig</div></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what's wrong?<ol><li><div>was is passiert?</div></li><li><div>was ist geschehen?</div></li><li><div>was ist los?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>How are you?<ol><li><div>was geht</div></li><li><div>was geht ab</div></li><li><div>was läuft</div></li><li><div>wie geht's</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what's your job?<ol><li><div>als was arbeiten Sie?</div></li><li><div>als was arbeitest du?</div></li><li><div>was machen Sie beruflich?</div></li><li><div>was machst du beruflich</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">phraseologicalUnit</font></div>what's your phone number?<ol><li><div>Wie lautet Ihre Telefonnummer?</div></li><li><div>Wie lautet deine Telefonnummer?</div></li><li><div>was ist Ihre Telefonnummer?</div></li><li><div>was ist deine Telefonnummer?</div></li></ol></div><div><div><font class="grammar" color="green">pronoun</font></div>person whose identity is unknown or forgotten<div>Dingsda</div></div><div>/<font color="gray">ˌwə.təˈbaʊ.tɪ.zəm</font>/<br>
<div><font class="grammar" color="green">noun</font></div>propaganda technique<div>Whataboutism</div></div><div>/<font color="gray">ˈwɒtʃəməˌkɔːlɪt</font>/, /<font color="gray">ˈwɔtʃəməˌkɔːɫət</font>/, /<font color="gray">ˈwʌt͡ʃməˌkɑlɪt</font>/, /<font color="gray">ˈwʌt͡ʃəməˌkɔlɪt</font>/<br>
